      "en": "Jonathan gave his weapons to his boy, and said to him, “Go, carry them to the city.”",
      "ko": "요나단이 그 병기를 아이에게 주며 이르되 이것을 가지고 성으로 가라",
      "source_text_hash": "cdbf12dfd9578ba59d48b9b6fdec8ff23690b4de6c22920dc648fbf154584e08",
      "translation_text_hash": "d71268c7465eca50e5ee444bc9c9dbb7e869617fd8741351244a6a03f45b2290",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
